crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "64fa99f36675eb664e283c87e5fa162d6427b5eb", "message": "Rename arms and add comments (pure refactor)", "created_at": "2021-07-23T03:04:55Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a424bd3f57bc29beec78e53a80b02dc3be2c5d85", "message": "Fix bug: failure if ship has left any graphs\n\nThe metadata-store maintains graph associations\nfor graphs a ship has joined and then left.\nHowever, these graphs no longer exist.\n\nIf you attempt to scry a graph that does not\nexist, the attempt fails and the caller crashes.\n\nTo remedy, check each graph-association-sourced\nresource against a set of resources scryed from\ngraph-store, which is up-to-date.", "created_at": "2021-07-21T16:18:41Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db0741e02bccf40cd14aa4b107ffd669c4f339de", "message": "Update outdated docs: `walk-graph` has been superseded", "created_at": "2021-07-21T15:41:20Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb7b650d8b147e2614ec4a3e8cc50e5d73fd888d", "message": "Update outdated docs: `to` type", "created_at": "2021-07-21T15:05:05Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bcd040295cc13968e3594b4247aadbb2d0ae1d14", "message": "Replace post content `,`s with `;`s to avoid interfering wtih delimiters", "created_at": "2021-07-19T01:24:44Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a4aaec76b8ce45ab92918877562fc6804df7bc21", "message": "Update README: time bounding", "created_at": "2021-07-19T00:46:21Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24317bdd8b33384f68bf504be4be0847305acb04", "message": "Only keep most recent edit entry in links/notes", "created_at": "2021-07-19T00:43:29Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e8085459a6199e2d5d75fb6eaff5e1c200b3f17", "message": "Fix time bounding\n\nAlthough a `graph` has newest elements first,\n`~(val by graph)` gives nodes with oldest\nelements first.\nAs a result, the order of the elements used\nby the convenience wrappers was\nopposite necessary to work properly with\n`filter-nodes-by-timestamp`.", "created_at": "2021-07-18T01:35:08Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "804538cf315e2bc85ba8a99022619d0a10e62314", "message": "Fix README typo", "created_at": "2021-07-17T19:29:00Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c1a1faedf2a240b322be6a245d2a33849ce7abca", "message": "Add (provisional) time bounding via `from` and `to` args", "created_at": "2021-07-17T19:28:12Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7feb0cd6f6569663b26e580662fdeeca452540ba", "message": "Switch polarity of generator `content` default by using a `(unit ?)` instead of a `?`", "created_at": "2021-07-17T17:24:27Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24054b4106e65c303ab5aee3a047f409a1719295", "message": "Rearrange library, grouping by arm category (pure refactor)", "created_at": "2021-07-15T01:11:03Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dc8c2ea9774517948bd3241a6df89ac04d41808d", "message": "Rearrange README to place generator first in usage", "created_at": "2021-07-13T03:29:25Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d84ad5e8aff8b24c876ea77d997d27abb8eeb453", "message": "Add hood/helm generator, filtering by group", "created_at": "2021-07-13T03:25:31Z", "repo": "crunch", "file_sampled": 